	'	'주민번호용 Aria키값으로 암호화하도록 설정(SetAriaNoBank())(Defualt-이체용Aria키값(SetAriaBank()))		
	'     edtNewPW.SetAriaNoBank()
	'     edtNewPWChk.SetAriaNoBank()
	'end if

	g_sSendData = Form.GetOpenLinkData()
